## Requirements

- C++17 compiler
- CMake ≥ 3.14
- Boost ≥ 1.81 (headers, `json`, and URL — Beast/Asio are header-only)

## Layout

- `api/` — generated service interfaces, typed request structs, per-operation
  responders, and route registration (`<Class>Api::attach`)
- `model/` — generated model types plus the shared OAS 3.1 exact-validation
  runtime (`Oas31*`) and schema registry
- `server/` — HTTP/1.1 runtime: `HttpServer`, `Router`, `Responder`,
  `Problem` (RFC 9457), `Authorizer`, parameter codecs, JSON body conversion

## Building

```sh
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
```

Warnings are errors by default (GCC/Clang `-Wall -Wextra -Werror`, MSVC
`/W4`); configure with `-DCPP_BOOST_BEAST_SERVER_WERROR=OFF` to relax this.

